        <name>x430_write_hook</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>A validated register write, before the value is stored (<ref refid="structx430__hooks_1ac8c1160f5c88e21a95f68b4bd2627b55" kindref="member">x430_hooks::write</ref>). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
